1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,469
I have started feeding the pigeons in the park every morning.

2
00:00:03,719 --> 00:00:07,058
They now recognize me. This was my first mistake.

3
00:00:07,308 --> 00:00:12,207
Yesterday, the fat one brought a friend. Today, the friend brought a lawyer.

4
00:00:12,457 --> 00:00:18,213
They staged a protest on my bench because the breadcrumbs were, and I quote, too artisanal.

5
00:00:18,463 --> 00:00:22,070
I tried to leave. They had already eaten my bus ticket.

6
00:00:22,320 --> 00:00:26,973
The park ranger says I am now legally their landlord. Rent is due on Friday.
